stamp, a journal, and errors and

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:12.320
omissions insurance. That's it. And

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:14.040
Angelina Nguyen was twenty-five years

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.160
old with no bachelor's degree when she

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:17.960
started charging seventy-five to two

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:19.800
hundred dollars an hour as a notary

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:21.320
signing agent. And on some mornings, she

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:23.080
makes a hundred and fifty dollars in

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:25.000
five minutes. And Barbara Hill stated

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:26.880
that after watching an elderly notary

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:29.080
walk through paperwork at her own home,

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:30.960
she now makes sixty-six thousand dollars

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:32.920
a year. And she does it with flexible

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:34.880
hours on her own schedule. So, the

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.680
certification process takes four to nine

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:38.640
weeks depending on your state, and after

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:40.440
that, you list yourself on national

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:42.080
signing databases, and title companies

00:09:40.440 --> 00:09:44.280
find you, and you show up when someone

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:46.200
needs a signature witnessed. And every

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.720
mortgage, every refinance, every home

00:09:46.200 --> 00:09:50.640
sale legally requires a notary to show

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:52.480
up in person, and that's not changing

00:09:50.640 --> 00:09:54.160
anytime soon. So, the notaries Angela

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:56.240
Nguyen's father worked with on real

00:09:54.160 --> 00:09:58.080
estate documents were, in her words, in

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:00.120
incredibly high demand. And that demand

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.480
is built into how property transactions

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.600
work in this country. So, yeah, this is

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:04.680
another one that can be a really good

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:07.160
one to get into. And yes, there are

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:09.800
entire YouTube channels about how to

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:11.000
become a notary as well. So, again, if

00:10:09.800 --> 00:10:12.040
you want to learn how to do YouTube,

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.400
click that link in the description in

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.840
the pin comment below and attend the

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:16.360
live training at this week where you

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:17.920
will literally get to ask me questions

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:19.760
live on Zoom. And also check out this

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:21.120
video right here where I go over exactly

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:24.280
how to start a YouTube channel and how

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:24.280
we help people grow with it.

